                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Young</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-05-02T12:00:00-04:40">May 2, 1929—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received
                        4:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>30. Department’s April 30, 2 p.m.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d458-f1"/> Permission
                    granted as requested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Young</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
